Follow DESIGN_SYSTEM.md.

Prioritize:
- typography
- whitespace
- hierarchy
- composition
- restraint

The aesthetic is "soft editorial minimalism with playful nostalgia."

Avoid generic AI/SaaS design patterns.

Playfulness should come from a few memorable details rather than
adding more UI.